  "question": "What's the closest park located in the northwest direction starting from the Coachlight Inn Motel, Oconto Falls, WI?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.144657 44.876538)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'park'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
